 medulloblastoma that is characterized as a molecular subtype by activation of the sonic hedgehog (SHH) pathway and TP53 mutations that may be present or absent.\" [DOID:0080703]\nsubset: doid {source=\"DOID:0080703\"}\nsubset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026590\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsubset: ncit {source=\"NCIT:C129441\"}\nsubset: rare\nxref: DOID:0080703 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\nxref: GARD:0026590 {source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nxref: MEDGEN:1375478 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\nxref: NCIT:C129441 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5002-8648\"}\nxref: UMLS:C4330671 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\", source=\"MEDGEN:1375478\"}\nis_a: MONDO:0007959 {source=\"DOID:0080703\"} ! medulloblastoma\nproperty_value: curated_content_resource \"https://www.malacards.org/card/medulloblastoma_shh_activated\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"MONDO:MalaCards\"}\nproperty_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/8567\" xsd:anyURI\n\n[Term]\nid: MONDO:0850198\nname: medulloblastoma non-WNT/non-SHH\ndef: \"A medulloblastoma that is characterized as a molecular subtype that is not associated with activation of the WNT pathway or sonic hedgehog (SHH) pathway and TP53 mutations are absent.\" [DOID:0080706]\nsubset: doid {source=\"DOID:0080706\"}\nsubset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026591\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsubset: ncit {source=\"NCIT:C129444\"}\nsubset: rare\nxref: DOID:0080706 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\nxref: GARD:0026591 {source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nxref: MEDGEN:1387799 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\nxref: NCIT:C129444 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5002-8648\"}\nxref: UMLS:C4330667 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\", source=\"MEDGEN:1387799\"}\nis_a: MONDO:0007959 {source=\"DOID:0080706\"} ! medulloblastoma\nproperty_value: curated_content_resource \"https://www.malacards.org/card/medulloblastoma_non_wnt_non_shh\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"MONDO:MalaCards\"}\nproperty_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/8567\" xsd:anyURI\n\n[Term]\nid: MONDO:0859008\nname: mosaic neurofibromatosis/schwannomatosis\nsubset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026651\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsubset: ordo_group_of_disorders {source=\"Orphanet:634518\"}\nsubset: orphanet {source=\"Orphanet:634518\"}\nsubset: rare\nxref: GARD:0026651 {source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nxref: MEDGEN:1843398 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\nxref: Orphanet:634518 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\nxref: UMLS:C5816781 {source=\"MEDGEN:1843398\", source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\nis_a: MONDO:0015356 {source=\"Orphanet:634518\", source=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432\"} ! hereditary neoplastic syndrome\nrelationship: has_characteristic MONDO:0700062 {source=\"PMID:35674741\"} ! mosaic\nproperty_value: curated_content_resource \"https://www.malacards.org/card/neurofibromatosis_schwannomatosis\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"MONDO:MalaCards\"}\nproperty_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9541\" xsd:anyURI\n\n[Term]\nid: MONDO:0859267\nname: tumor predisposition syndrome 2\ndef: \"An autosomal recessive cancer predisposition syndrome characterized by the onset of various types of tumors or malignancies in young adulthood. The most common clinical manifestations include acute myeloid leukemia (AML), myelodysplastic syndrome, colorectal adenomatous polyposis and carcinoma, and uveal melanoma.\" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5002-8648, OMIM:619975]\nsubset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026684\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsubset: omim {source=\"OMIM:619975\"}\nsubset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:661526\"}\nsubset: orphanet {source=\"Orphanet:661526\"}\nsubset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:661526\"}\nsubset: rare\nsynonym: \"MANS\" EXACT ABBREVIATION [OMIM:619975]\nsynonym: \"MBD4-associated neoplasia syndrome\" EXACT [OMIM:619975]\nsynonym: \"MBD4-related recessive tumor predisposition syndrome\" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0009-0004-3069-7846] {OMO:0002001=\"https://w3id.org/information-resource-registry/clingen\"}\nsynonym: \"TPDS2\" EXACT ABBREVIATION [OMIM:619975]\nxref: GARD:0026684 {source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nxref: MEDGEN:1823959 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\nxref: OMIM:619975 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\nxref: Orphanet:661526 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\nxref: UMLS:C5774186 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\", source=\"MEDGEN:1823959\"}\nis_a: MONDO:0015356 {source=\"OMIM:619975\", source=\"Orphanet:661526\"} ! hereditary neoplastic syndrome\nrelationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/6919 {source=\"OMIM:619975\"} ! MBD4\nproperty_value: curated_content_resource \"https://www.malacards.org/card/tumor_predisposition_syndrome_2\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"MONDO:MalaCards\"}\nproperty_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/8214\" xsd:anyURI\n\n[Term]\nid: MONDO:0859346\nname: mosaic variegated aneuploidy syndrome 7 with inflammation and tumor predisposition\nsubset: doid {source=\"DOID:0060982\"}\nsubset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026709\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsubset: omim {source=\"OMIM:620189\"}\nsubset: rare\nxref: DOID:0060982 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\nxref: GARD:0026709 {source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nxref: MEDGEN:1824057 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\nxref: OMIM:620189 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\nxref: UMLS:C5774284 {source=\"MEDGEN:1824057\", source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\nis_a: MONDO:0000141 {source=\"DOID:0060982\", source=\"OMIM:620189\"} ! mosaic variegated aneuploidy syndrome\nrelationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/6762 {source=\"OMIM:620189\"} ! MAD1L1\nproperty_value: curated_content_resource \"https://www.malacards.org/ca