{"type":"text","timestamp":1778977658200,"sessionID":"ses_1ccabf5d9ffeZtpHMjPNmVB0Gb","part":{"id":"prt_e3354bf5f001YsVDsbw1tVjW2T","messageID":"msg_e3354962c001vHJQG3zYsOkKPb","sessionID":"ses_1ccabf5d9ffeZtpHMjPNmVB0Gb","type":"text","text":"The closest precedent is a ClinGen-style neoplastic predisposition term under `hereditary neoplastic syndrome`, not a plain inherited susceptibility term. I’m validating the gene ID and collecting one literature source so the new stanza has grounded metadata instead of relying only on the issue text.","time":{"start":1778977652575,"end":1778977658199}}}
