{"type":"text","timestamp":1778977888489,"sessionID":"ses_1ccabf5d9ffeZtpHMjPNmVB0Gb","part":{"id":"prt_e3358403a001abDMKfAnxNS7Kt","messageID":"msg_e33583a9b00115hTtaVpg2RFU9","sessionID":"ses_1ccabf5d9ffeZtpHMjPNmVB0Gb","type":"text","text":"Implemented issue #9877 with a new term:\n\n- `MONDO:7770000` `GPR161-related medulloblastoma predisposition`\n\nCommitted locally as:\n\n- `ff8380c` `Add GPR161-related medulloblastoma predisposition`\n\nWhat I changed:\n- Added the new term under `MONDO:0015356` `hereditary neoplastic syndrome`\n- Added logical axioms for:\n  - `has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in` `HGNC:23694` (`GPR161`)\n  - `predisposes_towards` `MONDO:0007959` (`medulloblastoma`)\n- Added a definition and source support from `PMID:31609649`\n- Added the requested ClinGen-style preferred label annotation using `https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40157/`\n\nValidation:\n- Verified `GPR161` as `HGNC:23694`\n- Verified `PMID:31609649` is the paper `Germline GPR161 Mutations Predispose to Pediatric Medulloblastoma`\n- Ran syntax validation successfully with:\n  - `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o /tmp/opencode/mondo-edit.TMP.obo`\n\nFiles created and left uncommitted as requested:\n- `ISSUE_COMMENTS.md`\n- `PR_COMMENTS.md`\n\nConstraint noted:\n- Docker was not available in this environment, so I could not run `sh run.sh make NORM` / ODK-backed normalization. I documented that in `PR_COMMENTS.md`.","time":{"start":1778977882170,"end":1778977888487}}}
